  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Community Filmmaking and Gender, Impact and Public Engagement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project exploring participatory filmmaking as a development method to address gender inequality in the Pacific. Benefits local populations and practitioners in Papua New Guinea, Samoa, Solomon Islands, Tonga, Vanuatu, Tuvalu and Fiji. SDG 5, 10</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
